# Starting a game from its tile and going back to the home screen.
# Run: --boot off --fps 30 --frames 240
#
# With --boot off the home screen stands at frame 0, BENCH chosen.
# 10-28: right four times: CAMBER, DRIVE3D, HAIRPIN, KESTREL
10 press right
11 release right
16 press right
17 release right
22 press right
23 release right
28 press right
29 release right
# 50: the bottom face button starts KESTREL; its title menu shows the
#     craft over the ringed planet
50 press south
51 release south
# 120: Home opens the console's pause menu over the game (RESUME chosen)
120 press home
121 release home
# 140, 152: down twice, to BACK TO HOME
140 press down
141 release down
152 press down
153 release down
# 170: OK: the game ends and the home screen is back, KESTREL still chosen
170 press south
171 release south
